<title>ITALY: SOCCER-INTER V ANDERLECHT TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER V ANDERLECHT TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the UEFA Cup quarter-final second leg match between Internazionale of Italy and Anderlecht of Belgium on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Inter: 1-Gianluca Pagliuca; 2-Giuseppe Bergomi, 19-Massimo Paganin, 7-Salvatore Fresi, 20-Jocelyn Angloma, 4-Javier Zanetti, 8-Paul Ince, 21-Ciriaco Sforza, 6-Youri Djorkaeff, 23-Maurizio Ganz, 9-Ivan Zamorano.</p>
<p>Anderlecht: 1-Frederic Herpoel; 12-Olivier Doll, 14-Samuel Johnson, 18-Suwad Katana, 4-Celestine Babayaro; 2-Tibor Selymes, 11-Danny Boffin, 5-Johan Walem, 10-Par Zetterberg, 13-Bruno Versavel; 8-Yaw Preko.</p>
</text>
